{"about_the_game":"Throwback shooter where gibing is required, and being near death is mandatory.<br>Gibs give you ammo, and you can only heal when near death.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2178740/extras/56bd30d34aaf70991aa712088d682c26.poster.avif?t=1742231791\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2178740/extras/56bd30d34aaf70991aa712088d682c26.webm?t=1742231791\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2178740/extras/56bd30d34aaf70991aa712088d682c26.mp4?t=1742231791\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>The game will include 4 episodes, containing many maps.<br>Like an adrenaline shot, these maps are made to be cleared in one go, as brutally as possible.<br><br>Use your lead spitting arsenal to fend of waves of projectile blasting enemies, to survive in these<br>old school bullet hell gauntlets.<br><br>Sporting a hardcore industrial electronic soundtrack to get your adrenaline pumping, the bass will keep pumping<br>while you've still got blood in your veins (or health in your bar).<br><br>Inspired by the likes of Serious Sam and Duke Nukem 3D, this game is loyal to its roots, straight to the point, gory and action packed.<br><br>A short experience dense with oddities, bizarre environments and a lot of abominable sights.<br><br>This game includes auto-saves, and general settings customization including:<br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Sound Mixer<br></li><li> Resolution<br></li><li> Window Type<br></li><li> V-Sync</li></ul><br>Go for broke, or don't go at all.<br><br>The enemies are parasites, it's you against them.<br>Never yield.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2178740/extras/01335d8d9f667401726e7755051e0c87.avif?t=1742231791\" width=512 height=512 /></span>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Spread the Pain","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2178740/06248e78511c884e879855a3cd5a68e6d27ce729.jpg"},{"name":"Homicide","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2178740/87f20d495538151173d062bdbcd0265aa5e7de34.jpg"},{"name":"Parasiticide","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2178740/73099e1eec4cf92718c5519d0f785edb4030621d.jpg"},{"name":"Omnicide","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2178740/319f18cf65684b90cfec9330811ee7eaab0bf799.jpg"},{"name":"You staring at me?","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2178740/f9b2c41f13bf5ede2de6f0cc945584532bd73f1b.jpg"},{"name":"4D Chess","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2178740/5850930fed10e890ede765c7a6cb71753174c380.jpg"},{"name":"One Man Apocalypse","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2178740/8d0bb9d6f983c6213879506477632e616fe8e2b3.jpg"},{"name":"Guns Akimbo","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2178740/bed161c95f92d6e4a9561b9d74bb19936b51b02e.jpg"},{"name":"It's over...","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2178740/fba5d0c135861518660e523dc4202568da3f5f3c.jpg"},{"name":"Lost Senses, Gained Strength","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2178740/2dfab4a3f4a98c0d8c19eecff423e598f8c48ba6.jpg"}],"total":11},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2178740?t=1742231791","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2178740/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1742231791","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2178740/ca